{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent non-author per-block review receipt: 20 PASS rows for identity comment remediation.\nReviewer session: agent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\nImmutable before: ba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419\nMerged final: 7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c\nSchema: stable_block_id<TAB>before_citation<TAB>final_citation<TAB>preserved_contract_or_consumer<TAB>directives_exact<TAB>before_words<TAB>after_words<TAB>semantic-preservation<TAB>bloat-removal<TAB>reviewer_session\n\n```tsv\ntests/unit/test_identity_3183.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_3183.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_3183.py#D:<module>\tHappy-path authenticated-authorship gate tests. With enforcement on, verify-identity flags unsigned events; with it off, the gate is advisory. Write-gate, replay, and snapshot cases are held out.\tPASS\t56\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_3183_heldout.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_3183_heldout.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_3183_heldout.py#D:<module>\tHeld-out authenticated-authorship checks: replay folds bad signatures while counting signed/unsigned events; required unsigned writes fail fast; signed snapshot ledger entries still verify.\tPASS\t66\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_4e9d.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_4e9d.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_4e9d.py#D:<module>\tHappy-path event-attribution checks: local envelopes carry author_email and optional resolved author_id. Composer, compatibility, and cache cases are held out.\tPASS\t47\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_4e9d_heldout.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_4e9d_heldout.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_4e9d_heldout.py#D:<module>\tHeld-out attribution checks for all four local composers, legacy replay, email failure, per-repo cache, and reduced-state author surfacing.\tPASS\t64\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_ac1_401a.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_ac1_401a.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_ac1_401a.py#D:<module>\tHappy-path identity write-gate checks: accept public authorized keys; reject a private key at CREATE without writing an event. KEY_ADD is held out.\tPASS\t53\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_ac1_401a_heldout.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_ac1_401a_heldout.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_ac1_401a_heldout.py#D:<module>\tHeld-out private-key checks: KEY_ADD rejects the case-insensitive header family and writes no event.\tPASS\t41\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_ac7_bff8.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_ac7_bff8.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_ac7_bff8.py#D:<module>\tHappy-path verify-identity gate: --all runs the check and --require-authenticated enforces unsigned-event failure even with config off. Alias, --since, JSON, and CI cases are held out.\tPASS\t56\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_ac7_bff8_heldout.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_ac7_bff8_heldout.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_ac7_bff8_heldout.py#D:<module>\tHeld-out verify-identity checks: removed alias rejection, --since grandfathering, JSON schema, and CI workflow wiring.\tPASS\t46\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_bde5.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_bde5.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_bde5.py#D:<module>\tHappy-path authorship attestation checks: the policy registers at import and verifies an event against its author's in-band public keys.\tPASS\t58\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_bde5_heldout.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_bde5_heldout.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_bde5_heldout.py#D:<module>\tHeld-out authorship checks: reject cross-identity and tampered signatures; unknown or keyless identities remain non-verified without raising. Trust roots come only from the subject identity's in-band keys.\tPASS\t68\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_ddbe.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_ddbe.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_ddbe.py#D:<module>\tHappy-path identity entity checks. create_identity writes one identity CREATE with email, mappings, and keys; show_ticket exposes it. use_identity stores the pointer; resolution reads it or falls back to a case-insensitive Git email match.\tPASS\t97\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_ddbe_heldout.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_ddbe_heldout.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_ddbe_heldout.py#D:<module>\tHeld-out identity checks: seven-site type exemptions, resolver fallbacks to None, generated-type registration, and CLI creation.\tPASS\t50\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_enforce_since_grandfather.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_enforce_since_grandfather.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_enforce_since_grandfather.py#D:<module>\tCheck enforce_since via environment config on a mixed store. Pre-boundary unsigned events are grandfathered in JSON; later events fail enforcement. A boundary commit itself is enforced, not grandfathered.\tPASS\t151\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_gate_archived_and_unresolvable_heldout.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_gate_archived_and_unresolvable_heldout.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_gate_archived_and_unresolvable_heldout.py#D:<module>\tHeld-out gate checks: archived tickets leave enforcement scope while active unsigned events remain flagged. Signed snapshot ledger entries with unresolvable null commit SHAs must verify without era failure.\tPASS\t180\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_gate_archived_and_unresolvable_heldout.py#D:test_unresolvable_null_commit_ledger_does_not_fail_gate\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_gate_archived_and_unresolvable_heldout.py#D:test_unresolvable_null_commit_ledger_does_not_fail_gate\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_gate_archived_and_unresolvable_heldout.py#D:test_unresolvable_null_commit_ledger_does_not_fail_gate\tA signed ledger entry with a null commit and unresolvable position remains verified and exits 0. Corrupt only the position, which is outside the signature's UUID and content-hash binding.\tPASS\t79\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_gate_scope_and_ledger.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_gate_scope_and_ledger.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_gate_scope_and_ledger.py#D:<module>\tGate scope and ledger regression checks. Reducer-ignored unsigned sidecars stay outside enforcement; known state events remain in scope. Re-resolve null snapshot ledger commits by position so valid signatures verify, and persist resolved commits during compaction.\tPASS\t154\t35\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_perf_1cc0.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_perf_1cc0.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_perf_1cc0.py#D:<module>\tVerify-identity resolves introducing commits in one Git history pass. Check batch-map parity with the per-event resolver and prevent the gate from falling back to one subprocess per event.\tPASS\t115\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_perf_1cc0.py#D:test_gate_does_not_call_per_event_resolver\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_perf_1cc0.py#D:test_gate_does_not_call_per_event_resolver\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_perf_1cc0.py#D:test_gate_does_not_call_per_event_resolver\tWith the batch map covering active events, the gate never invokes the per-event resolver.\tPASS\t51\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_ts1_c96d.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_ts1_c96d.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_ts1_c96d.py#D:<module>\tHappy-path in-toto authorship: sign_event_authorship binds event UUID and content hash in a DSSE Statement; verify_event_authorship checks the author's in-band keys. Failure and primitive cases are held out.\tPASS\t62\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\ntests/unit/test_identity_ts1_c96d_heldout.py#D:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/test_identity_ts1_c96d_heldout.py#D:<module>\t7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c:tests/unit/test_identity_ts1_c96d_heldout.py#D:<module>\tHeld-out in-toto authorship checks: reject cross-identity, tampered, malformed, unknown, and keyless cases. Content hash excludes author_sig while covering other fields; low-level signing primitives remain available.\tPASS\t73\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792743280839420340,"uuid":"39bc3eb5-2bbe-4bd1-926d-3da4cab8459a"}